  twoharbors: [{ h: 'Why dive here', body: ['Two Harbors is Catalina\'s isthmus anchorage with shore and boat diving in kelp and reef at the narrow waist of the island.', 'Protected compared to Avalon front side; hub for west-end Catalina trips. Adjacent 4th of July Cove (Franko description only — wrong-location pin withheld): 0\u2032–30\u2032, 42 moorings but zero anchorage; historic Banning family 4th of July beach; private beach.'] }, { h: 'Navigation, POIs & hazards', body: ['Boat or shore from Two Harbors mooring field. Cat Harbor and Isthmus Reef nearby.', 'Skiff traffic in mooring field; verify MPA boundaries. Private-beach / no-anchorage rules apply in parts of the isthmus cove complex.'] }, { h: 'Marine life by zone', body: ['Kelp (15–35 ft): garibaldi, kelp bass, sheephead, opaleye.', 'Outer reef: calico bass, yellowtail when warm water pushes.'] }],
